<title>HONG KONG: IDT Int'l interim profit up 42 percent.</title>
<headline>IDT Int'l interim profit up 42 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   11.9  vs  9.0 (see note)</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.5   vs  2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    33.8  vs  23.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		     546.0 vs  549.4</p>
<p>    Company name		 IDT International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 11-15, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 23</p>
<p>NOTE - IDT International makes electronic products.</p>
<p>Share earnings for period in 1995 was adjusted to give a comparative figure after the issue of shares by the company under the scrip dividend scheme for 1996 final dividend.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
